Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,===================== XXX =====================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准看！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体变得好丑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且为何这么臭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有种腐烂的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是猫怪的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正面目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.39,0:02:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夹…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.43,0:02:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被看到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了 这下全完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.77,0:02:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:03:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是被猫怪附身的他隐藏着的另一个面目
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有被猫怪附身的人才会变成那种异形
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气味很恶心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.86,0:03:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得害怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夹…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本田透？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这里淋雨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真惨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真狼狈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你了解草摩家什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道诅咒真正的可怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所能活的日子已经不多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是注定的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把十二生肖的诅咒一手包下来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到底对你期待什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道认为你能救草摩家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果你还不是如此狼狈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情不会这么结束的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然像你这样的女孩介入了草摩家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就要让你更后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慊人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你啦 害我淋得跟落汤鸡一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:07:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为是你的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:37.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道却…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 算了吧 不然你也会完蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由希你为何不追出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你现在讨厌阿夹了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来就讨厌那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然他是猫 我是老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们互相厌恶的关系就不会有所改变
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那到底是谁准备好的藉口呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真叫人难过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.23,0:09:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乐罗你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:09:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么不去追阿夹？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.17,0:10:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不追
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管阿夹变成什么样子我都会接受他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没有人比我更爱阿夹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.55,0:10:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.62,0:10:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我很明白的 我追去也没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的阿夹只有小透能救他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乐罗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被同样身为十二生肖的我所接受
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对阿夹来说只是种安慰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我和阿夹太亲近了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以只好拜托小透救他了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？奇怪耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:11:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是阿夹的颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.35,0:12:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那孩子连哭都没哭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是自己的母亲死了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当初没生这个被猫怪附身的孩子就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就不会因为过度忧郁而死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 不是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你了解就好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:27.21,Default - TOP,NTP,0,0,0,,初次见面 我叫做草摩籍真
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的错…不是我的错…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 我都了解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我一起生活？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:13:02.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看我这样子 我可是空手道道场的老师喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你也有兴趣那就一起来学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 是阿夹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,籍真真的要收养他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算他父亲没能力带他 但这样籍真实在太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 还这么年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然要帮人带一个被猫怪附身的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以后你要多吸一些
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高处的空气才行喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 你是"师父"吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.91,0:14:00.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电视上都称呼空手道的老师为"师父"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你也是师父吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.31,0:14:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你说得对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我的门生倒是没人这样子叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在斗志上我是不输给老师的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩都进步很多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 听到您这么说 我真的好高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 老师…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:28.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师父
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.41,0:14:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来啦 阿夹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么老要用暴力来解决事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对方只不过是嘲笑你的发色
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的父亲来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说是他的养父 到底是怎么教他的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然会收养一个被猫怪附身的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看籍真一定是疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.79,0:14:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师父才不是我老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:14:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高一点的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来啦 阿夹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我是想赎罪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.23,0:15:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祖父和阿夹一样都是被猫怪所附身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.50,0:15:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家族的人都疏远他还到处中伤他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.07,0:15:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害他一直过得很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和祖父只见过一次面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 籍真
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你点心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要 不然会被诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我说了很残忍的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑着原谅了我的无礼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是一个那么好的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来祖父去世 我也长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:23.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以第三者的身分看到阿夹的处境
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然感到一阵痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人的愚蠢、残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有行为都和我们以前没两样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要跟我一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了赎罪 我收养了他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我是想藉此来消除自己的罪恶感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起生活 朝夕相处
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.99,0:17:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对他产生了爱怜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次看到满脸笑容的他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对他的爱就越深
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越来越重视他、担心他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越希望他能得到幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直就像个父亲的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我无视他的心情抢了他的念珠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:44.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬要他接受我的作法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他又不是我的老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么突然要过来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:18:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道不能明天和小透一起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不自觉的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是电波啊？算了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日子一定会吓一跳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到我们居然半夜…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里干嘛 全身都淋湿了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小鱼…和小花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.26,0:18:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没资格回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.47,0:18:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来就没资格待在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛啊 花岛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.85,0:19:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不能去抱小透 电波是这么告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.60,0:19:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你应该去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你非去不可
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.19,0:19:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 花岛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.33,0:19:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.63,0:20:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花岛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走 你快走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有非作不可的事 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.45,0:20:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊 花岛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.89,0:20:22.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么忙也帮不上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一能做的就是叫你去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.59,0:20:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你快点去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊！
